// # MCP Subsystem — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Front door for the mcp/ directory. Engine plus cli, qa, scripts, docs, examples, and audit.
//
// Setup: Six engine subdirs. Version is the git tag. There is no VERSION file.
//
// Beats:
//   1. engine/ is the library: core, tool, health, federation, state, resource.
//   2. cli/ is the mcp binary: stdio/file server and mcp-merge.
//   3. qa/ has six hostile probes that return Err on failure.
//   4. scripts/ has build, test, verify, release; all fail closed.
//   5. docs/ is the live protocol surface. audit/ is historical only.

import "engine/ANCHOR.oo";
import "cli/ANCHOR.oo";
import "qa/ANCHOR.oo";
import "scripts/ANCHOR.oo";
import "docs/ANCHOR.oo";
import "examples/ANCHOR.oo";
import "audit/ANCHOR.oo";
